{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f29fd7fb177e4e0762a6df2114ea801e/2026-11/010.png\"/><p>北角發生交通意外。今日（4日）晚上10時許，一輛食環署外判承辦商中型貨車沿英皇道往筲箕灣方向行駛，至新光戲院對開、準備左轉入書局街時，撞到一名正在過馬路的40多歲女子。她應聲倒地，昏迷不醒，由救護車送往東區醫院搶救，警方正調查事件。</p><p>現場消息指，女傷者沒有表面傷痕，沒有生命危險；涉事貨車事發時載有兩名工人，事後由拖車拖走作進一步檢驗。</p><img alt=\"一輛中型貨車由英皇道左轉入書局街時撞到一名女途人。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ae10a51cf264ef02e9cf909211e76d3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_23_08_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"司機接受警方調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/795ab128fdc8f41c5f05f403329d845a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_23_08_37.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨車的左邊車頭撞到女途人。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60ffbb7e17a4b5756be3f6ffda5e9589/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_23_08_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一輛中型貨車由英皇道左轉入書局街時撞到一名女途人。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a30d157a52eca6592e0b3af431b430b9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_23_08_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為英皇道及書局街交界。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da5aca2cf0f7047c72f0e5d8f08cba84/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_23_08_34.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:50.100607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:57:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:43.844017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:52.717639+00:00","content_hash":"f08392204d6af0e2de6f210aba1698586eaf6fa626e9558999139c75f7987ee1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}